# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# CORS (mobile app fetching the API directly. localhost:8081/127.0.0.1:8081
# cover the Expo web dev server; the ts.net:8443 origin covers the app
# actually running on a phone through the Tailscale Funnel. Both are
# needed at once — CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS being SET in .env at all replaces
# settings.py's own localhost default rather than adding to it, so
# leaving either one out here would silently drop it.)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
